 "9102": {
  "en": [
   "Victory to you, victory.",
   "You have hung around the homeland's neck an unfading garland of glory.",
   "For long days India's voice had stayed silent, bearing its disgrace;",
   "today you have wakened it and proclaimed it across the world.",
   "The new flame of light you have kindled in the temple of knowledge",
   "has set a shining mark on the brow of all your brothers.",
   "May your chariot of victory range unhindered today through all the world,",
   "may whatever sorrow and poverty are ours not stay to bind you."
  ],
