 "9103": {
  "en": [
   "Make the pilgrim-courtyard of world-learning gloriously bright today.",
   "Shine forth, assembly of blessed sons.",
   "Fulfil the long waiting of the dense night of darkness; take the initiation of light.",
   "Pilgrims all, make ready; let the divine vina sound.",
   "Come, workers; come, the wise; come, you intent on the people's good,",
   "come, king of ascetics!",
   "Come, society rich in the power of mind, freed of every bond."
