 "9104": {
  "en": [
   "You are the priest of the world — in this world of yours",
   "one longs to win the other, and two long to be one.",
   "Flower embraces flower, the sun and the dawn entwine.",
   "Cloud sees cloud and comes running; star gazes toward star.",
   "Your law is fulfilled, O Lord; the victory is yours —",
   "by your grace these two hearts today have become one.",
   "The hand with which you bound the moon in love to the earth",
   "with that same hand you have bound these two hearts, heart to heart.",
   "The world sings victory, victory; a clamour of joy has risen,",
   "the wind of love is blowing — love's fragrance streams abroad.",
   "Sing, O birds, your song; tell it, wind, through all creation —",
   "in Mahesh's world of love, today love has won the victory."
  ],
