 "9106": {
  "en": [
   "On this blessed day, at this blessed hour, the earth with joyful heart",
   "has offered today the flowers of two hearts as gift —",
   "see, they lie there at your feet;",
   "take them up in your right hand, King of kings.",
   "With one thread, God, string them together —",
   "let it not break, not tear; let them stay in that hand.",
   "With your dew keep them alive —",
   "lest, who knows, they wither in the world's harsh sunlight."
