 "9107": {
  "en": [
   "Become one, you two; lay your heads at the feet of the One —",
   "may your two hearts today be joined in his union's shade.",
   "In the surge of his love may two souls awaken —",
   "may all that is withered and stained break beneath his feet.",
   "Before you lies the world's road; do not fear its hindrances —",
   "go, you two, go on your way — go singing his victory.",
   "Take devotion for provision; may your strength be unconquerable —",
   "may the blessing-word of fearlessness come on his grace's breeze."
