 "9108": {
  "en": [
   "From his boundless realm of blessing",
   "into the woodland shade of your hearts",
   "in a stream of the Infinite's touch",
   "spring has been wakened today.",
   "So the nectar-filled blossom of union",
   "has opened — when, we never knew —",
   "this blossom, this offering of worship —",
   "bow down, both of you, at his feet.",
   "May every obstacle fall away from you;",
   "may the stream of his blessing descend.",
   "May it wipe away the stains of sullied dust;",
   "may the wind of peace blow unbound.",
   "In the sweetness of ever-new love",
   "may the fruit of good ripen in both your hearts;",
   "may your happiness for ever keep giving,",
   "swelling the joy of all the world."
