 "9109": {
  "en": [
   "On the journey-road of new life grant, oh grant this boon,",
   "O heart's Lord —",
   "may the wealth of love fill the heart full;",
   "may your gracious face reign amid this world;",
   "in joy may we receive your alms, in sorrow receive your initiation;",
   "may the mind be freed of pettiness, be joined with the whole world;",
   "may it know no weariness in works of good —",
   "peace, peace, peace."
