 "9110": {
  "en": [
   "On love's union-day, the true witness, the Indwelling One —",
   "I bow to him — I bow, I bow.",
   "He who is companion day and night, in danger and fortune, in joy and sorrow, the Indwelling One —",
   "I bow to him — I bow, I bow.",
   "He whose gaze in the dark of night is in star after star,",
   "whose gaze crosses the bounds of life and death,",
   "whose gaze is in the blazing sunlight, in the flame of fire, in every creature's soul — the Indwelling One,",
   "I bow to him — I bow, I bow.",
   "Offer all life's works, the world's duties, at his feet.",
   "He who is witness of the universe, the Indwelling One —",
   "I bow to him — I bow, I bow."
