 "9111": {
  "en": [
   "Blessed bride, keep the honey of tenderness stored in your soul. Ah.",
   "Be true in love, be steadfast in well-being —",
   "in sorrow and joy stay calm, with a smiling face.",
   "Be victorious over blows, gracious in unshaken patience. Ah.",
   "Walk heeding the word of good counsel;",
   "by the grace of compassionate humility let peace spread on every side —",
   "make your household tender with forgiveness.",
   "Let no pride of possessions belittle the soul.",
