 "9112": {
  "en": [
   "Give these your blessing.",
   "Little lives are blossoming on the earth; they bring news of paradise.",
   "Lest these smiling faces forget their smiles,",
   "lest darkness and peril close around them,",
   "call them near, hold them to your breast, take them on your lap,",
   "and give them your blessing.",
   "Say, 'Go in happiness, treading the waves of the world;",
   "may a wind come from heaven —",
   "make light of joy and sorrow, they are only the play of waves",
   "dancing all around you.'"
