 "9113": {
  "en": [
   "Before us lies the ocean of peace —",
   "launch the boat, O Helmsman.",
   "You will be the eternal companion — take me, take me into your lap —",
   "on the path to the Infinite will burn the light of the Pole Star.",
   "Giver of freedom, your forgiveness, your mercy",
   "will be the eternal provision of the eternal journey.",
   "May the mortal world's bonds dissolve; may the vast universe open its arms and gather us in —",
   "may the heart find fearless acquaintance with the great Unknown."
