 "9114": {
  "en": [
   "Those who once went and killed him",
   "in the name of the king —",
   "in this age those same ones are born again today;",
   "they come to the temple dressed as devotees —",
   "calling the killer soldiery,",
   "they raise the cry 'Kill, kill!'",
   "The voice of worship-chants mingles with the roar —",
   "the Son of Man in piercing pain says: O God,",
   "this cup is filled with cruel poison —",
   "cast it far away, cast it far away, quickly."
