   "for those who thirst for light, their eyes upraised,",
   "who have lost their way beneath the shadows of dusk,",
   "while before them the night of despair closes in.",
   "Those who, lost to themselves in your whole wide world,",
   "search for the Pole Star through the veil of darkness —",
   "bring their sight into the world of form —",
   "onto the path of light."
