 "9116": {
  "en": [
   "Behold, the Great Man comes.",
   "A thrill runs in every direction",
   "through blade after blade of the grass of mortal dust.",
   "In the realm of gods the conch rings out;",
   "in the realm of men the victory-drum sounds —",
   "the hour of the great birth has come.",
   "Today all the fortress-gates of the moonless night",
   "have crashed broken to the dust.",
   "On the peak of dawn wakes the cry 'Fear not, fear not'",
   "in the assurance of new life.",
   "'Victory, victory, victory to the rising of Man'",
   "thundered forth across the great sky."
