 "9117": {
  "en": [
   "O Ever-new,",
   "let the first blessed moment of birth appear once more.",
   "Let your appearing come, unveiling the mist,",
   "like the sun.",
   "Piercing the breast of emptiness, reveal yourself.",
   "Let the victory of life be made manifest,",
   "let the eternal wonder of the Infinite be made manifest in you.",
   "On the horizon of sunrise the conch sounds; within my heart",
   "a call goes out to the Ever-new —",
   "the twenty-fifth of Baishakh."
